    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the current cluster configuration in Raft v2. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>During a joint-consensus transition the object holds <emphasis>both</emphasis> the old and the new member sets. A majority is only granted when a majority in <emphasis>each</emphasis> set independently has voted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
